  "name": {
   "zh": "抠像 · BiRefNet",
   "en": "Matte · BiRefNet"
  },
  "intro": {
   "zh": "BiRefNet 是用于高分辨率二分图像分割（DIS）的双边参考框架，由定位模块和带双边参考的还原模块组成。这张卡逐帧抠出画面主体，不用点选，再用「边缘解混合」去掉边缘里混进来的背景色，交付一套多层 EXR：rgba 是修正后的前景（预乘），foreground 是未修正前景，alpha 是遮罩；也常给精细抠像当粗遮罩。",
   "en": "BiRefNet is a bilateral reference framework for high-resolution dichotomous image segmentation (DIS). This card mattes the main subject frame by frame without picking, then removes the background color mixed into the edges with edge unmixing. It delivers a multi-layer EXR: rgba is the corrected foreground (premultiplied), foreground the uncorrected foreground, alpha the mask. Also a common rough mask for fine mattes."
  },
  "author": "Lab2Shot",
  "created": "2026-09-11T11:00:00",
  "deliverable": "matte_alpha",
  "owner": "admin",
  "updated": "2026-10-03T01:00:00"
 },
